(2) Deposits shall be repayable from the Hajj Fund with such bonus thereon as is provided by this Act, and such other outgoings, subject to section 23, as are directed by this Act to be paid out of the Hajj Fund. Expenditure of Perbadanan TAIB in relation to Hajj Fund [S 18/2022]
